# fixedbugs, defect 2062, lane b17-ffi, 2026-10-14.
#
# SYMPTOM: `via`, the union member spelled right, declared `i32`: told
# *`Tagged.via` is `union (unnamed union at <file>:<line>:<col>)`*, its note
# *correct `via`*, which no type a field is declared with can do.
#
# FIX: told as a union with no name of its own, the record `partial` without
# it and a function of the program's own the spellings that build.

extern "fixedbugs-2062-records.h"
    record Tagged tag tagged
        kind: i32
        via: i32  #~ ffi_field_type

function main()
    t = Tagged(kind: 2, rest: zero)
    print(t.kind)
